Z||000000||isthiswhereiputausername?||10-12-2001||09:15 AM||||how hard is it to switch the steering column from an 85se with tilt to my 84sc so i will have the tilt?<P>thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrossum||10-12-2001||09:32 AM||||30 min job.........have to make sure that both are man shift type or auto shift type.||||reg||10
Z||000002||isthiswhereiputausername?||10-12-2001||11:03 AM||||Thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  yep   both are standards||||reg||1
Z||000003||falconhulk||10-12-2001||11:35 AM||||forgive me mrossum<BR>if this is a stupid question:  What diffrence does it make if they are autos or manuals?  Did some of them have col shifters?||||reg||1
Z||000004||Rodrv6||10-12-2001||12:09 PM||||The automatic columns have a cable interlock that attatches to the shifter to prevent removing the ignition key unless the transmission is in park.  The manual columns have a lever to release the key instead.<P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  <BR>White 88 GT :)||||reg||1
Z||000005||theogre||10-12-2001||07:23 PM||||easy job... If both columns are otherwise identically optioned.<P>4 screws hold the plastic trim up<BR>4 nuts/bolts holt the column bracket up. (Don't remove the 4 short bolts that hold the bracket to the column...)<BR>1 bolt thru the universal to free that. (The universal's bolt must be removed. Loose won't do it.)<P>If you have one with cruise and one w/o then you may have to pull the steering wheel and lock plate to change turn signal stalks. This is annoying but not difficult.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000006||isthiswhereiputausername?||10-13-2001||03:56 PM||||Thanks  Guess I will try to find time this weekend to get it done  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>who would we need to talk to to raise the numbers of hours in a day?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> 24 is not enough anymore  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
